{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29926","headline":"咸阳有怀 · 陈上美","name":"咸阳有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山连河水碧氛氲，瑞气东移拥圣君。\n秦苑有花空笑日，汉陵无主自侵云。\n古槐堤上莺千啭，远渚沙中鹭一羣。\n赖与渊明同把菊，烟郊西望夕阳曛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈上美","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}